# AdMob Integration Rules

- Use official AdMob test unit IDs for development and CI; never ship test IDs in production builds.
- Keep production AdMob IDs in environment/config layers, not hardcoded in Dart widgets.
- Add a release checklist item to verify ad IDs and consent flow per environment.

# Sensitive Screen Restrictions

- Never show ads on screens that reveal full card data, unlock prompts, or security settings.
- Do not place interstitial or rewarded ads in flows that can interrupt secure actions.
- Keep ad requests isolated from sensitive card context; do not pass card metadata in targeting fields.

# Privacy and Policy

- Implement consent flow where legally required before personalized ads.
- Support non-personalized ad mode and respect user consent changes at runtime.
- Do not initialize ad SDK tracking until consent state is known when required by region.
- Ensure privacy policy text covers ad usage, data processing, and user controls.

# Agent Refusal Behavior

- Refuse any request to mix full card data with ad analytics or ad targeting.
- Refuse implementations that force personalized ads without consent handling.
